{
    "title": "Sport Watch Face PER009 Mesa",
    "description": "\"PER009 Mesa\" is a digital WearOS watch face designed by PERSONA\r\n\r\nMore details:\r\nhttps://persona-wf.com\r\n\r\nInstallation Guide:\r\nBefore leaving negative feedback (1 star) on Google Play, please read the installation guide and frequently asked questions (FAQ) list.\r\nhttps://persona-wf.com/installation/ \r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nDigital 12/24hr (based on phone settings)\r\nWeather Type & Feeling Temperature\r\nUV Index & Chance of Rain\r\n6 changeable backgrounds\r\n6 changeable line colors\r\n6 dial colors\r\n10 changeable colors, AOD included\r\nHeart rate & zone\r\nSteps\r\nDistance Km / Mile\r\nAlways ON display supported with changeable colors\r\nDate\r\nBattery Level\r\n\r\nImportant!\r\nTo see weather information invoke the customization mode and select \"WEATHER\" for custom data.\r\n\r\nCustomization:\r\nTouch and hold the display to open customization mode. You can customize the field with any data you want. For example, you can select weather, time zone, sunset/sunrise, barometer, next appointment, and more.\r\n\r\nSupported Devices:\r\nSAMSUNG:\r\nGalaxy Watch Ultra / Galaxy Watch 7\r\nGalaxy Watch 6 /  6 Classic\r\nGalaxy Watch 5 /  5 Pro\r\nGalaxy Watch 4 / 4 Classic\r\nFOSSIL: Gen 7, Gen 6, Gen 6 Wellness, Gen 6 Hybrid, Gen 5e, Wear, Sport, Michael Kors Gen 6\r\nMOBVOI: TicWatch Pro 5, Pro 3 GPS, Pro 3 LTE, E3, Pro 4G, C2, E2/S2, Pro\r\nGOOGLE: Pixel Watch 2, Pixel Watch\r\nXIAOMI: Watch 2 Pro, Watch 2\r\nOPPO: Watch 2, Watch X\r\nMONTBLANC: Summit 3, 2, 2+, Lite, Summit\r\nSUUNTO: Suunto 7\r\nNEW BALANCE: RunIQ\r\nPOLAR: M600\r\nTAG HEUER: Connected E4, Connected 2020\r\nAnd all other Wear OS devices with API Level 33+\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPERSONA is awarded as Best Innovative Design\r\nAward ceremonial video:\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cM2QteNtlF8 \r\n\r\nIf you have further questions or need support, please do not hesitate to contact me. \r\nI\u2019m here to help!  support@persona-wf.com\r\n\r\nSign up to stay updated with new watch faces and promotions!\r\nhttps://persona-wf.com/register\r\n\r\nFACEBOOK\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/Persona-Watch-Face-502930979910650\r\n\r\nINSTAGRAM\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/persona_watch_face\r\n\r\nTELEGRAM\r\nhttps://t.me/persona_watchface\r\n\r\nYOUTUBE\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/c/PersonaWatchFace\r\n\r\nFOR MORE\r\nhttps://persona-wf.com\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\nSincerely, \r\n\r\nAyla GOKMEN",
